<view class="page"><view class="hero card"><text class="eyebrow">{{today}} · 从今天开始</text><block wx:if="{{activePlan}}"><view class="hero-plan-row"><view class="hero-plan-main"><text class="hero-title">{{activePlan.questionBankName}}</text><text class="hero-copy">计划第 {{activePlan.dayOffset}} 天 · 预计完成 {{activePlan.estimatedFinishDate}}</text></view><view class="streak {{activePlan.checkedInToday ? 'streak-checked' : ''}}"><text class="streak-value">{{activePlan.streak}}</text><text class="streak-label">连续打卡</text></view></view></block><block wx:else><text class="hero-title">像背单词一样<br/>刷算法题</text><text class="hero-copy">你还没有启用计划，先选择一套题库开始吧。</text><button class="hero-button" bindtap="createPlan">创建我的斩杀计划</button></block></view><block wx:if="{{activePlan}}"><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">今日新刷</text><text class="muted">按题库顺序</text></view><view class="task-list" wx:if="{{newProblems.length}}"><view class="task card {{item.isCompletedToday ? 'task-completed' : ''}}" wx:for="{{newProblems}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="openProblem" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-bank-code="{{activePlan.questionBankCode}}" data-task-type="new"><view class="task-index">{{item.isCompletedToday ? '✓' : index + 1}}</view><view class="task-info"><text class="task-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="task-meta">{{item.isCompletedToday ? '今日已刷 · ' : ''}}{{item.category}} · {{item.difficulty}}</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view></view><view class="empty card" wx:else><text class="empty-icon">○</text><text>今天没有新的刷题安排。</text></view><view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">今日复刷</text><text class="muted">逾期优先</text></view><view class="task-list" wx:if="{{reviewProblems.length}}"><view class="task card review-task" wx:for="{{reviewProblems}}" wx:key="id" bindtap="openProblem" data-id="{{item.id}}" data-bank-code="{{activePlan.questionBankCode}}" data-task-type="review"><view class="task-index">{{item.level}}</view><view class="task-info"><text class="task-title">{{item.title}}</text><text class="task-meta">{{item.isOverdue ? '此前漏刷 · ' : '今日到期 · '}}{{item.category}} · {{item.difficulty}}</text></view><text class="arrow">›</text></view></view><view class="empty card" wx:else><text class="empty-icon">○</text><text>暂无到期复习。</text></view></block><view class="empty card" wx:if="{{!activePlan && !loadingTasks}}"><text class="empty-icon">○</text><text>创建计划后，这里会出现每日新刷与复刷任务。</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{showLoginSheet}}" class="login-mask"><view class="login-sheet"><text class="login-title">登录码秘，开始你的斩杀计划</text><text class="login-copy">确认后将使用微信昵称创建专属学习档案，不读取头像。</text><view class="login-actions"><view class="login-defer" bindtap="deferLogin">暂不登录</view><button class="login-confirm" loading="{{loginLoading}}" disabled="{{loginLoading}}" bindtap="confirmLogin">确认登录</button></view></view></view>
